    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glaebārĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glēb-</span></b> ), a,
